# Security policy
{.lead} Report vulnerabilities privately; the engine is built to render untrusted content safely.

---

## Reporting a vulnerability

Please do not open a public issue for a security problem.

:::callout warning
Email Barprojectsandbuilds@gmail.com with the details and steps to reproduce. You will get an acknowledgement, and a fix or mitigation will follow.
:::

---

## Supported versions

This project is pre-1.0 (0.x). Security fixes land on the latest commit on `main`.

---

## Notes on the engine

The MDP engine renders content that may be untrusted, and is built to do so safely.

- Input is HTML-escaped before rendering.
- Link schemes are restricted so only safe links pass through.
- The source format intentionally allows no raw HTML, no inline CSS, and no scripting.

:::callout note
If you find a way to inject markup or a script through an MDP source, please treat it as a vulnerability and report it.
:::
